# env.optional — enrichment / signal-scale / send / store keys (all degrade to the keyless backbone).
# if set -> contact-finding + funding/leadership data; else -> keyless serp + email pattern-guess
APOLLO_API_KEY
# if set -> LinkedIn/event/competitor signal scale; else -> serp / Playwright web-automation
APIFY_API_TOKEN
# if set -> email-finding fallback; else -> pattern-guess
DROPCONTACT_API_KEY
# if set -> verify deliverability; else -> local syntax/dedup (higher bounce risk)
MILLIONVERIFIER_API_KEY
# Send/launch — if a send key is set -> launch via cold-email-outreach / linkedin-outreach;
# else -> export a tool-ready CSV (the keyless default) to send manually.
# sequenced cold email
LEMLIST_API_KEY
# sequenced cold email
INSTANTLY_API_KEY
# automated LinkedIn send (with LINKEDIN_SESSION_COOKIE)
PHANTOMBUSTER_API_KEY
# for the phantombuster LinkedIn send path
LINKEDIN_SESSION_COOKIE
# Store — if set -> durable cache/metrics/CRM; else -> workspace file-cache CSV ledger (default).
SUPABASE_URL
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY
# if set -> CRM read/write for cache + logging; else -> file cache
HUBSPOT_API_KEY
